    "rich_text_JKEt8m": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_6UFjX9": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>FGF-2 is an important egg bioactive growth factor and has been shown to activate most types of cells in the body. It acts at the DNA level. It is known to<strong>activate bone cells near the site of the joints to help stimulate cartilage repair.</strong>This factor has been shown to activate stem cells which lay in the various tissues and organs of the body. W<strong>hen activated, healthy stem cells can help repair and regenerate cells for restoring healthier tissues. </strong></p><p>Special amino acids (including all 22 of them) and natural chondroitin also support joint tissue repair.</p><p>We \"age\" because the body faces a constant problem. Telomeres (the protective caps on our chromosomes) are clipped shorter and shorter as cells divide and the body gets less efficient at producing new cells.</p><p><strong>FGF-2 is needed to support telomere activity.</strong></p><p>The problem is, the availability of FGF-2 to the human body diminishes over time and essentially vanishes as we age. Since our body relies less on our own production of FGF-2 , we can take advantage of mother nature’s rare source and obtain it from the LifePharm proprietary egg extract.</p><p>This explains why LAMININE has demonstrated a wide range of benefits for different people, and in varying parts of the body.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
