            "content": "<p>Amino acids are essential for <strong>protecting and rebuilding joint cartilage</strong>, and when combined with our proprietary LifePharm egg extract the results are nothing short of amazing.</p><p><br/></p><p>That’s why LAMININE contains all 22 amino acids that your body needs for maximum health, so when tissue damage occurs <strong>your body has the essential nutrients and biofactors necessary to help in its repair.</strong></p><p>“I had aching joints all along my back and I experienced discomfort sitting and bending down. But since I've been taking LAMININE, it doesn't hurt that much.”</p><h5><strong>Steve G.</strong></h5>",
