            "column_size": "1.5",
            "title": "",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>But by lowering cortisol levels in the body, LAMININE helps to end this cycle. <br/><br/><strong>References:<br/></strong><a href=\"https://lifepharm.com/media/pdf/laminine/ENG-LaminineCortisol-Study.pdf?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>LAMININE - Cortisol Study<br/></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4263906/?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>NCBI - Chronic Stress, Cortisol Dysfunction, and Pain</strong></a></p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
