      "blocks": {
        "richtext_Mk3M6V": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<h4><strong>LAMININE</strong></h4><p>Summary published in Prescriber's Digital Reference - <a href=\"https://www.pdr.net/full-prescribing-information/Laminine-fertilized-avian-egg-extract-marine-protein-phyto-protein-3591?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\">https://www.pdr.net/full-prescribing-information/LAMININE-fertilized-avian-egg-extract-marine-protein-phyto-protein-3591</a></p><p>LAMININE Reduces CRP, an Inflammation Marker, in Subjects With Joint Soreness and Stiffness  - <a href=\"https://www.lifepharm.com/Media/Studies/Laminine%20CRP%20Andujar,_%20LAMININE.pdf?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\">https://www.lifepharm.com/Media/Studies/LAMININE%20CRP%20Andujar,_%20LAMININE.pdf</a><br/></p><h4><strong><br/>FIBROBLAST GROWTH FACTOR</strong></h4><p>Allouche M, Bikfalvi A. The role of fibroblast growth factor-2 (FGF-2) in hematopoiesis[J]. Progress in growth factor research, 1995, 6(1): 35-48.<br/>Itkin T, Ludin A, Gradus B, et al. FGF-2 expands murine hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells via proliferation of stromal cells, c-Kit activation, and CXCL12 down-regulation[J]. Blood, 2012, 120(9): 1843-1855. - <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/8714368?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/8714368</a><br/><br/></p><p>Lai W T, Krishnappa V, Phinney D G. Fgf2 Inhibits Differentiation of Mesenchymal Stem Cells by Inducing Twist2 and Spry4, Blocking Extracellular Regulated Kinase Activation and Altering Fgfr Expression Levels[J]. Stem cells (Dayton, Ohio), 2011, 29(7): 1102. - <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21608080?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21608080</a><br/><br/></p><p>Eiselleova L, Matulka K, Kriz V, et al. A Complex Role for FGF‐2 in Self‐Renewal, Survival, and Adhesion of Human Embryonic Stem Cells[J]. Stem Cells, 2009, 27(8): 1847-1857. - <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19544431?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19544431</a></p><h4><strong><br/>CORTISOL</strong></h4><p>LAMININE - Cortisol Study: <a href=\"https://lifepharm.com/media/pdf/laminine/ENG-LaminineCortisol-Study.pdf?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://lifepharm.com/media/pdf/LAMININE/ENG-LAMININECortisol-Study.pdf</a></p><p>Arthritis.org - What Triggers an Arthritis Flare?: <a href=\"https://www.arthritis.org/health-wellness/healthy-living/managing-pain/pain-relief-solutions/what-triggers-an-arthritis-flare?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.arthritis.org/health-wellness/healthy-living/managing-pain/pain-relief-solutions/what-triggers-an-arthritis-flare</a></p><p>NCBI - Chronic Stress, Cortisol Dysfunction, and Pain: <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4263906/?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4263906/</a></p><h4><strong><br/>GLYCINE</strong></h4><p>NCBI - High glycine concentration increases collagen synthesis...: <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6153947/?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6153947/</a></p><h4><strong><br/>Telomere Activity</strong></h4><p>LAMININE (fertilized avian egg extract/marine protein/phyto protein) - Full Prescribing Information - <a href=\"https://www.pdr.net/full-prescribing-information/Laminine-fertilized-avian-egg-extract-marine-protein-phyto-protein-3591?ref=retaildirect&ref=retaildirect\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.pdr.net/full-prescribing-information/LAMININE-fertilized-avian-egg-extract-marine-protein-phyto-protein-3591</a></p>"
          }
        }
